  "description": "Signal path of THAT2180 datasheet Figure 2, including the 20 k\u03a9 input and transimpedance resistors and the 22 pF feedback capacitor. The gain cell is a room-temperature current-transfer macromodel with implicit nominal bias. Change the EC\u2212 rail to sweep gain. Leave symmetry adjustment open on the hardware.",
